Fire official means the fire officer or other designated authority, or their duly authorized representative, charged with the administration and enforcement of this article.
Master plats means all original plats drawn in accordance with this article; all copies distributed shall be from this original drawing.
New building means any commercial structure or public facility whose certificate of occupancy was issued after the effective date of Ordinance No. 4782 from which this article is derived.
Plats means the maps created by the building owner and approved by the fire marshal which depict the location and boundaries of land and all existing fire lanes in accordance with this article. Such maps shall be drawn to scale.
